{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55610","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 八 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧峤经年常寂寂，更无闲事可相於。\n超伦每效高僧行，得力难忘古佛书。\n落叶乱渠凭水荡，浮云翳月倩风除。\n方知懒与真空合，一衲闲披憇旧庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}